	"notice": "CC numbers are checked against the manufacturer manual. Connect a MIDI output to the matching input and enable MIDI/CC reception in the device settings. MIDI channel is user-selectable; no USB port-name aliases are assumed. The drawing is a partial grouped control inventory, not a scale panel layout. Touch-key note bindings are virtual defaults and may require octave adjustment. Menu-dependent controls are not automatically bound. NRPN, SysEx preset/sequence transfers, firmware updates and multi-message operations require a protocol-aware application and are not implemented by these static controls. Use the supplied 3.5 mm TS-to-DIN adapter. Amp level is 0-9 and most continuous sound parameters are 0-99. MIDI Tx/Rx channel-changing CCs 14/15 are omitted from the performance controls.",
